# Adult Waifu Card Battler

A turn-based card battler in Godot 4 where players collect waifu cards and fight AI opponents in a story-driven adult campaign featuring mature themes like violence and political assassinations.

## Features
- Deck building and customization (core to gameplay)
- Turn-based battles with waifu summons, effects, and AI opponents
- Story integration with Dialogic (branching paths, player choices alter story, leading to demon invasion climax)
- Waifu romance: Affection levels, gifting (vendors/loot), select up to 3 for conditional buffs
- Exploration: Many maps and dungeons with varying lengths and rewards
- Factions: Multiple factions vying for power; player can help or hinder
- Multiple endings based on choices, allies, waifu survival, faction standings (e.g. save world with losses, bad ending where demons win)
- Pixel sprites for characters/effects, hand-drawn cards/maps/backgrounds
- Save/load system for decks, progress, inventory, story choices
- Mobile support planned but low priority (Android/iOS TOS concerns)

## Requirements
- Godot 4.6 (download from godotengine.org)
- Addons: Dialogic 2 (in addons/ folder)

## How to Run
1. Clone the repo: `git clone https://github.com/rekore/adult-waifu-card-battler`
2. Open Godot editor → Import → select project.godot
3. Click Play (or F5) — starts from main scene (TBD, currently placeholder)

## Development Setup
- See docs/project-bible.md for architecture and roadmap
- Tests in tests/ (gdUnit4)

